\viewkind4\uc1\pard\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. BLESSED Jesus, here we stand,
\par Met to do as Thou hast spoken;
\par And this child, at Thy command,
\par Now we bring to Thee in token
\par That to Christ it here is given,
\par For of such shall be His heaven.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. Therefore hasten we to Thee;
\par Take the pledge we bring, O take him;
\par Let us here Thy glory see,
\par And in tender pity make him never,
\par Now Thy child, and him never,
\par Thine on earth, and Thine for ever.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3. Now upon Thy heart it lies,
\par What our hearts so dearly treasure;
\par Heavenward lead our burdened sighs;
\par Pour Thy blessing without measure;
\par Write the name we now have given,
\par Write it in the book of heaven.
\par                          Amen.\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\fs16 
\par }

